And so it's actually kind of a fitting moment because we had, I remember that writer's guild strike being a moment, those three months of going, I can't believe how much my life has changed, you know, because from the summer or the spring summer between season two and season three, that was just the one of the more turbulent times in my life for sure, coming in and doing those like 10 or so episodes before the writer's guild strike.
所以这其实是一个很合适的时刻，因为我记得那次编剧工会罢工是一个转折点，那三个月里我一直在想，我不敢相信我的生活发生了多大的变化，因为从第二季和第三季之间的那个春夏，那绝对是我人生中最动荡的时期之一，在编剧工会罢工前，我回来拍了大约10集左右。

