00:55:35.989 --> 00:55:45.780
And he'll have all of those songs perfect and, and he'll play tennis with you and he will, he will bring you a lot of joy.
他会完美地演奏所有这些歌曲，他会和你们一起打网球，他会给你们带来很多快乐。

00:55:45.780 --> 00:55:50.500
He will, he will teach you about unconditional love to take it back to what you said, Josh.
