00:55:50.500 --> 00:55:57.380
I think we both, one of the commonalities is probably that this was my truest introduction into what unconditional love really means.
我想我们俩的共同点之一，可能就是这是我真正理解什么是无条件的爱的开端。

00:55:57.380 --> 00:56:04.980
And he will unlock a whole other way of looking at the world and existing that you can't understand right now.
他会开启一种全新的看待世界和存在的方式，这是你现在无法理解的。

00:56:04.980 --> 00:56:09.380
Now I'm gonna go, this geneticist is gonna come in and tear your fucking life apart.
现在我要走了，那位遗传学家要进来了，他会彻底摧毁你们的生活。

00:56:09.380 --> 00:56:13.110
You're gonna be the lowest part you've ever been in life.
你们会经历人生中最灰暗的时刻。

00:56:13.110 --> 00:56:18.829
But just remember that I time traveled here to tell you this one sneak peek and it's gonna be worth it.
但请记住，我穿越时空来到这里，就是为了给你们这个小小的剧透，这一切都是值得的。

00:56:18.829 --> 00:56:29.389
Crawl through this Shawshank sewer and there's something right out there on the other side And it's going to be this wonderful boy, this wonderful young man.
爬过这道《肖申克的救赎》式的下水道，另一边会有东西等着你们，那将是这个美妙的男孩，这个美妙的年轻人。

00:56:29.389 --> 00:56:33.269
It's worth crawling through the shit to get there.
为了到达那里，爬过这些污秽是值得的。

00:56:33.269 --> 00:56:37.110
And I would love to be able to go back and say that to them.
我真希望能回到过去对他们说这些。

00:56:37.110 --> 00:56:37.610
Yeah.
是的。

00:56:37.610 --> 00:56:38.949
I can't.
