人们称之为“孤儿综合征”或“孤儿疾病”，这些疾病非常罕见，可能没有名人代言，因此很难获得资金。

01:15:09.819 --> 01:15:19.899
We live in a weird country where medicine and insurance and research, it's all the capitalism piece doesn't help and people don't get what they need.
我们生活在一个奇怪的国家，医疗、保险和研究都受到资本主义的影响，这并没有什么帮助，人们往往得不到他们需要的支持。

01:15:19.899 --> 01:15:31.779
And so there is a lot of DIY and a lot of roll up your sleeves and like, let's raise the money to lift up this community and we try to do our best and that the whole JS community and Dr. Grossfeld, everyone does such amazing work.
所以，很多时候需要靠自己，卷起袖子，筹集资金来帮助这个群体。我们尽了最大努力，整个雅各布森综合征（JS）社区和格罗斯菲尔德博士，每个人都做了非常了不起的工作。

01:15:31.779 --> 01:15:36.260
So thank you guys for that and thank you for this platform to talk about it.
所以谢谢你们，也谢谢这个平台让我能谈论这件事。

01:15:36.260 --> 01:15:37.260
I appreciate it.
我很感激。

01:15:37.260 --> 01:15:53.119
Thank you for sharing so honestly and vulnerably crag, we, yeah, I, you know, I got, I said it a lot the other night, but I love you and I love talking about this TV show we made together.
谢谢你如此诚实和坦率地分享，克雷格，我们，是的，我，你知道，那天晚上我说了好几次，但我爱你，我也喜欢谈论我们一起制作的这部电视剧。

01:15:53.119 --> 01:15:56.159
And yeah, thanks to everyone for listening.
是的，感谢大家的收听。

01:15:56.159 --> 01:16:01.840
I love YouTube, by the way, before we get that in before we're going to get back to our regularly.
顺便说一句，我爱YouTube，在我们回到常规节目之前。

01:16:01.840 --> 01:16:02.505
I love you.
我爱你。

